        <mxCell id="note_N1" value="PDF, DOCX, TXT or MD, under 10 MB and 200 pages, at&lt;br&gt;most 20 per writer (FR-84). A document is the&lt;br&gt;writer&#x27;s alone: it never feeds writer memory,&lt;br&gt;Portfolio Insights or search, and no other account&lt;br&gt;can read, attach or discover it (FR-87)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=10;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;fontStyle=2;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="408" width="346" height="94" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note_N2" value="Citations appear only when attached documents&lt;br&gt;supplied passages. With none attached, the assistant&lt;br&gt;writes from the writer&#x27;s published work (FR-86)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=10;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;fontStyle=2;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="362" y="408" width="352" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
